+`window-toggle-fullscreen-in-tile` tells the window it is fullscreen while it
+keeps its tile, or its floating box, with gaps, borders, and panels around it.
+Browsers and players hide their own interface as they would in fullscreen. The
+application's own unfullscreen request (Escape on a video, F11) ends the mode;
+a fullscreen request while in it changes nothing. `window-toggle-fullscreen`
+moves a window in this mode to real fullscreen, and leaving that exits both.
+Running the action on a fullscreen window brings it back to its tile and keeps
+it fullscreen there.
+
 ## Scratchpad
 
 Scratchpads are global named holding areas that roam between outputs.
